{"v":1,"source":"tools/eiken-series-bank.json","grades":[{"id":"5","label":"5級","sets":[{"n":1,"questions":[{"id":"5-01-01","n":1,"kind":"cloze","q":"My aunt is a teacher at a ( school / river / kitchen ).","answer":"school","accepted":["school"],"why":"英語を教える場所は学校。riverは川、kitchenは台所です。"},{"id":"5-01-02","n":2,"kind":"cloze","q":"A: Is this your bag? B: No. It is ( he / his / him ).","answer":"his","accepted":["his"],"why":"「彼のもの」は所有代名詞his。heは主語、himは目的語です。"},{"id":"5-01-03","n":3,"kind":"cloze","q":"We have music class ( on / at / in ) Friday.","answer":"on","accepted":["on"],"why":"曜日の前にはonを使います。時刻の前はatです。"},{"id":"5-01-04","n":4,"kind":"cloze","q":"My sister ( like / likes / liking ) oranges, but I like apples.","answer":"likes","accepted":["likes"],"why":"主語My sisterは三人称単数。現在形の動詞にsを付けます。"},{"id":"5-01-05","n":5,"kind":"cloze","q":"There ( is / are / am ) two bicycles behind the house.","answer":"are","accepted":["are"],"why":"two bicyclesは複数なのでThere areを使います。"},{"id":"5-01-06","n":6,"kind":"cloze","q":"A: ( Who / Where / When ) is your lunch box? B: On the desk.","answer":"Where","accepted":["Where"],"why":"答えが場所なのでWhere。「誰」ならWho、「いつ」ならWhenです。"},{"id":"5-01-07","n":7,"kind":"cloze","q":"Ken can ( swims / swim / swimming ) very fast.","answer":"swim","accepted":["swim"],"why":"助動詞canの直後は動詞の原形です。"},{"id":"5-01-08","n":8,"kind":"cloze","q":"Listen! The children are ( sing / sings / singing ) in the next room.","answer":"singing","accepted":["singing"],"why":"areと動詞のing形で、今している動作を表します。"},{"id":"5-01-09","n":9,"kind":"cloze","q":"A: ( How / What / Which ) many notebooks do you have? B: Three.","answer":"How","accepted":["How"],"why":"数をたずねる決まった形はHow manyです。"},{"id":"5-01-10","n":10,"kind":"cloze","q":"I am hungry. Let's ( eat / drink / wear ) these sandwiches.","answer":"eat","accepted":["eat"],"why":"サンドイッチを食べるのでeat。飲むはdrink、着るはwearです。"},{"id":"5-01-11","n":11,"kind":"order","q":"「私は毎朝、犬と歩きます。」( every / walk / I / morning / my dog / with )","answer":"I walk with my dog every morning.","accepted":["I walk with my dog every morning.","Every morning I walk with my dog."],"why":"主語I、動詞walk、with my dog、時を表すevery morningの順。"},{"id":"5-01-12","n":12,"kind":"order","q":"「あなたのお父さんは何時に起きますか。」( your father / does / get up / what time )","answer":"What time does your father get up?","accepted":["What time does your father get up?"],"why":"What timeのあとにdoes、主語、動詞の原形を置きます。"},{"id":"5-01-13","n":13,"kind":"order","q":"「箱の中にボールが一つあります。」( a ball / is / in the box / there )","answer":"There is a ball in the box.","accepted":["There is a ball in the box."],"why":"存在を表すThere isと、物、場所を並べます。"},{"id":"5-01-14","n":14,"kind":"order","q":"「その女の子は今、本を読んでいます。」( now / a book / reading / the girl / is )","answer":"The girl is reading a book now.","accepted":["The girl is reading a book now.","Now the girl is reading a book."],"why":"主語、is、reading、目的語、nowの順です。"},{"id":"5-01-15","n":15,"kind":"reading","q":"何曜日に図書室が開きますか。英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"Saturday","accepted":["Saturday"],"why":"文のon Saturdayが曜日を示しています。","context":"The school library opens at nine on Saturday. A story reading starts at ten. Please bring a pencil. You can borrow two books. The library closes at twelve.","title":"A notice"},{"id":"5-01-16","n":16,"kind":"reading","q":"読み聞かせは何時に始まりますか。数字で答えなさい。","answer":"10","accepted":["10"],"why":"A story reading starts at ten.が根拠。開館の9時とは違います。","context":"The school library opens at nine on Saturday. A story reading starts at ten. Please bring a pencil. You can borrow two books. The library closes at twelve.","title":"A notice"},{"id":"5-01-17","n":17,"kind":"reading","q":"何冊まで借りられますか。数字で答えなさい。","answer":"2","accepted":["2"],"why":"borrow two booksから2冊と分かります。","context":"The school library opens at nine on Saturday. A story reading starts at ten. Please bring a pencil. You can borrow two books. The library closes at twelve.","title":"A notice"},{"id":"5-01-18","n":18,"kind":"reading","q":"Yukiが日曜日にするスポーツを英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"tennis","accepted":["tennis"],"why":"I play tennis thereが根拠です。","context":"Hi Mei, I live near a park. I play tennis there with my brother on Sundays. Today it is rainy, so we are at home. My brother is making lunch. I am drawing a picture of our cat. See you, Yuki","title":"An email"},{"id":"5-01-19","n":19,"kind":"reading","q":"今日の天気を英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"rainy","accepted":["rainy"],"why":"Today it is rainyと明記されています。","context":"Hi Mei, I live near a park. I play tennis there with my brother on Sundays. Today it is rainy, so we are at home. My brother is making lunch. I am drawing a picture of our cat. See you, Yuki","title":"An email"},{"id":"5-01-20","n":20,"kind":"reading","q":"Yukiは何の絵を描いていますか。英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"cat","accepted":["cat"],"why":"a picture of our catから猫の絵と分かります。","context":"Hi Mei, I live near a park. I play tennis there with my brother on Sundays. Today it is rainy, so we are at home. My brother is making lunch. I am drawing a picture of our cat. See you, Yuki","title":"An email"}]},{"n":2,"questions":[{"id":"5-02-01","n":1,"kind":"cloze","q":"The train ( leaves / leave / leaving ) at seven every morning.","answer":"leaves","accepted":["leaves"],"why":"三人称単数の現在形は動詞にsを付けます。"},{"id":"5-02-02","n":2,"kind":"cloze","q":"A: Are those your shoes? B: Yes, they are ( my / mine / me ).","answer":"mine","accepted":["mine"],"why":"名詞を続けず「私のもの」と言うにはmineを使います。"},{"id":"5-02-03","n":3,"kind":"cloze","q":"The swimming pool is closed ( on / at / to ) Mondays.","answer":"on","accepted":["on"],"why":"曜日の前にはonを使います。"},{"id":"5-02-04","n":4,"kind":"cloze","q":"Please put your books ( under / about / from ) the desk, not on it.","answer":"under","accepted":["under"],"why":"onとの対比から「下に」のunderです。"},{"id":"5-02-05","n":5,"kind":"cloze","q":"A: ( Who / Where / How ) is that man? B: He is our coach.","answer":"Who","accepted":["Who"],"why":"人が誰かをたずねるのでWhoです。"},{"id":"5-02-06","n":6,"kind":"cloze","q":"My parents ( don't / doesn't / isn't ) watch TV in the morning.","answer":"don't","accepted":["don't"],"why":"主語parentsが複数なのでdon'tと動詞の原形です。"},{"id":"5-02-07","n":7,"kind":"cloze","q":"A: Can you ride a bike? B: Yes, I ( can / do / am ).","answer":"can","accepted":["can"],"why":"Canで聞かれた質問にはcanで答えます。"},{"id":"5-02-08","n":8,"kind":"cloze","q":"Be quiet. The baby is ( sleeps / sleep / sleeping ).","answer":"sleeping","accepted":["sleeping"],"why":"isとing形で今眠っている様子を表します。"},{"id":"5-02-09","n":9,"kind":"cloze","q":"We need a ( spoon / jacket / ticket ) to eat this soup.","answer":"spoon","accepted":["spoon"],"why":"スープを食べる道具はspoonです。"},{"id":"5-02-10","n":10,"kind":"cloze","q":"A: How old is your dog? B: ( It / Its / It's ) is two.","answer":"It","accepted":["It"],"why":"文の主語はIt。Itsは所有、It'sはIt isでisが重なります。"},{"id":"5-02-11","n":11,"kind":"order","q":"私は日曜日に祖父母を訪ねます。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( Sundays / visit / on / grandparents / my / I )","answer":"I visit my grandparents on Sundays.","accepted":["I visit my grandparents on Sundays."],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-02-12","n":12,"kind":"order","q":"あなたの弟は何が欲しいですか。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( does / want / your / What / brother )","answer":"What does your brother want?","accepted":["What does your brother want?"],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-02-13","n":13,"kind":"order","q":"窓のそばに椅子が二つあります。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( are / by / There / window / chairs / the / two )","answer":"There are two chairs by the window.","accepted":["There are two chairs by the window."],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-02-14","n":14,"kind":"order","q":"私たちの先生は今、話しています。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( teacher / now / is / talking / Our )","answer":"Our teacher is talking now.","accepted":["Our teacher is talking now."],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-02-15","n":15,"kind":"reading","q":"本の販売がある曜日を英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"Thursday","accepted":["Thursday"],"why":"本文の根拠：Our class has a book sale on Thursday.","context":"Our class has a book sale on Thursday. It starts at three in the afternoon. All books are one dollar. Please bring a bag. We will use the money to buy flowers for the school garden.","title":"A school sale","evidence":"Our class has a book sale on Thursday."},{"id":"5-02-16","n":16,"kind":"reading","q":"販売は午後何時に始まりますか。数字で答えなさい。","answer":"3","accepted":["3"],"why":"本文の根拠：It starts at three in the afternoon.","context":"Our class has a book sale on Thursday. It starts at three in the afternoon. All books are one dollar. Please bring a bag. We will use the money to buy flowers for the school garden.","title":"A school sale","evidence":"It starts at three in the afternoon."},{"id":"5-02-17","n":17,"kind":"reading","q":"買った本を入れるために持ってくる物を英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"bag","accepted":["bag"],"why":"本文の根拠：Please bring a bag.","context":"Our class has a book sale on Thursday. It starts at three in the afternoon. All books are one dollar. Please bring a bag. We will use the money to buy flowers for the school garden.","title":"A school sale","evidence":"Please bring a bag."},{"id":"5-02-18","n":18,"kind":"reading","q":"Makiが起きる時刻を数字で答えなさい。","answer":"6","accepted":["6"],"why":"本文の根拠：Maki gets up at six on school days.","context":"Maki gets up at six on school days. She feeds her rabbit before breakfast. Her father makes breakfast, and her mother washes the dishes. Maki walks to school with her neighbor. Today she is taking a picture of her rabbit for art class.","title":"A busy morning","evidence":"Maki gets up at six on school days."},{"id":"5-02-19","n":19,"kind":"reading","q":"Makiのペットを英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"rabbit","accepted":["rabbit"],"why":"本文の根拠：She feeds her rabbit before breakfast.","context":"Maki gets up at six on school days. She feeds her rabbit before breakfast. Her father makes breakfast, and her mother washes the dishes. Maki walks to school with her neighbor. Today she is taking a picture of her rabbit for art class.","title":"A busy morning","evidence":"She feeds her rabbit before breakfast."},{"id":"5-02-20","n":20,"kind":"reading","q":"朝食を作る家族を英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"father","accepted":["father"],"why":"本文の根拠：Her father makes breakfast, and her mother washes the dishes.","context":"Maki gets up at six on school days. She feeds her rabbit before breakfast. Her father makes breakfast, and her mother washes the dishes. Maki walks to school with her neighbor. Today she is taking a picture of her rabbit for art class.","title":"A busy morning","evidence":"Her father makes breakfast, and her mother washes the dishes."}]},{"n":3,"questions":[{"id":"5-03-01","n":1,"kind":"cloze","q":"A: Is your mother a doctor? B: No, she ( isn't / doesn't / aren't ).","answer":"isn't","accepted":["isn't"],"why":"Isと主語sheに対する否定の返事はshe isn'tです。"},{"id":"5-03-02","n":2,"kind":"cloze","q":"My brother ( has / have / having ) a camera in his bag.","answer":"has","accepted":["has"],"why":"主語が三人称単数なのでhaveではなくhasです。"},{"id":"5-03-03","n":3,"kind":"cloze","q":"The festival starts ( at / on / for ) five o'clock.","answer":"at","accepted":["at"],"why":"時刻の前にはatを使います。"},{"id":"5-03-04","n":4,"kind":"cloze","q":"A: ( When / Where / Who ) is the party? B: Next Sunday.","answer":"When","accepted":["When"],"why":"答えが時を示すのでWhenです。"},{"id":"5-03-05","n":5,"kind":"cloze","q":"These are my sisters. ( They / Them / Their ) play volleyball.","answer":"They","accepted":["They"],"why":"複数の人を文の主語にするのでTheyです。"},{"id":"5-03-06","n":6,"kind":"cloze","q":"( Do / Does / Is ) your friends like animals?","answer":"Do","accepted":["Do"],"why":"your friendsが複数なので疑問文にはDoを使います。"},{"id":"5-03-07","n":7,"kind":"cloze","q":"Let's ( walk / walking / walks ) to the museum.","answer":"walk","accepted":["walk"],"why":"Let'sの直後は動詞の原形です。"},{"id":"5-03-08","n":8,"kind":"cloze","q":"Look at the sky! It is ( rains / raining / rain ).","answer":"raining","accepted":["raining"],"why":"isとing形で今雨が降っていることを表します。"},{"id":"5-03-09","n":9,"kind":"cloze","q":"I want to write a letter. Please give me some ( paper / water / bread ).","answer":"paper","accepted":["paper"],"why":"手紙を書くための紙なのでpaperです。"},{"id":"5-03-10","n":10,"kind":"cloze","q":"This is ( a / an / the ) apple. That is a banana.","answer":"an","accepted":["an"],"why":"appleは母音の音で始まるのでanを付けます。"},{"id":"5-03-11","n":11,"kind":"order","q":"私の母はバスで仕事に行きます。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( by / bus / mother / My / goes / to / work )","answer":"My mother goes to work by bus.","accepted":["My mother goes to work by bus."],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-03-12","n":12,"kind":"order","q":"あなたはどこで昼食を食べますか。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( lunch / eat / Where / do / you )","answer":"Where do you eat lunch?","accepted":["Where do you eat lunch?"],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-03-13","n":13,"kind":"order","q":"その赤い自転車は私のものです。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( mine / bicycle / is / red / That )","answer":"That red bicycle is mine.","accepted":["That red bicycle is mine."],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-03-14","n":14,"kind":"order","q":"彼らは公園でサッカーをしています。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( playing / They / soccer / are / the / park / in )","answer":"They are playing soccer in the park.","accepted":["They are playing soccer in the park."],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-03-15","n":15,"kind":"reading","q":"最初に見る動物を本文と同じ英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"elephants","accepted":["elephants"],"why":"本文の根拠：They see elephants first.","context":"Ben is at the zoo with his aunt. They see elephants first. At eleven, a keeper talks about penguins. Ben wants to hear the talk. His aunt buys sandwiches for lunch. After lunch, they go to the gift shop. Ben buys a small toy lion.","title":"At the zoo","evidence":"They see elephants first."},{"id":"5-03-16","n":16,"kind":"reading","q":"飼育員の話は何時ですか。数字で答えなさい。","answer":"11","accepted":["11"],"why":"本文の根拠：At eleven, a keeper talks about penguins.","context":"Ben is at the zoo with his aunt. They see elephants first. At eleven, a keeper talks about penguins. Ben wants to hear the talk. His aunt buys sandwiches for lunch. After lunch, they go to the gift shop. Ben buys a small toy lion.","title":"At the zoo","evidence":"At eleven, a keeper talks about penguins."},{"id":"5-03-17","n":17,"kind":"reading","q":"Benが買うおもちゃの動物を英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"lion","accepted":["lion"],"why":"本文の根拠：Ben buys a small toy lion.","context":"Ben is at the zoo with his aunt. They see elephants first. At eleven, a keeper talks about penguins. Ben wants to hear the talk. His aunt buys sandwiches for lunch. After lunch, they go to the gift shop. Ben buys a small toy lion.","title":"At the zoo","evidence":"Ben buys a small toy lion."},{"id":"5-03-18","n":18,"kind":"reading","q":"美術クラブが集まる教室は何号室ですか。数字で答えなさい。","answer":"4","accepted":["4"],"why":"本文の根拠：The art club meets in Room Four on Tuesdays.","context":"The art club meets in Room Four on Tuesdays. We draw animals this week. You need a pencil and colored paper. The teacher brings scissors, so you do not need them. The club starts at four and finishes at five.","title":"An art club notice","evidence":"The art club meets in Room Four on Tuesdays."},{"id":"5-03-19","n":19,"kind":"reading","q":"今週描くものを英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"animals","accepted":["animals"],"why":"本文の根拠：We draw animals this week.","context":"The art club meets in Room Four on Tuesdays. We draw animals this week. You need a pencil and colored paper. The teacher brings scissors, so you do not need them. The club starts at four and finishes at five.","title":"An art club notice","evidence":"We draw animals this week."},{"id":"5-03-20","n":20,"kind":"reading","q":"先生が持ってくる道具を英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"scissors","accepted":["scissors"],"why":"本文の根拠：The teacher brings scissors, so you do not need them.","context":"The art club meets in Room Four on Tuesdays. We draw animals this week. You need a pencil and colored paper. The teacher brings scissors, so you do not need them. The club starts at four and finishes at five.","title":"An art club notice","evidence":"The teacher brings scissors, so you do not need them."}]},{"n":4,"questions":[{"id":"5-04-01","n":1,"kind":"cloze","q":"A: Where are your glasses? B: ( They / It / Their ) are in my bag.","answer":"They","accepted":["They"],"why":"glassesを受ける複数の主語はTheyです。"},{"id":"5-04-02","n":2,"kind":"cloze","q":"My uncle ( drives / drive / driving ) a bus for his job.","answer":"drives","accepted":["drives"],"why":"主語が三人称単数なのでdrivesです。"},{"id":"5-04-03","n":3,"kind":"cloze","q":"We eat dinner ( in / on / at ) the evening.","answer":"in","accepted":["in"],"why":"in the eveningという組み合わせで使います。"},{"id":"5-04-04","n":4,"kind":"cloze","q":"A: ( What / Who / When ) is your favorite fruit? B: Peaches.","answer":"What","accepted":["What"],"why":"好きな果物が何かを尋ねるのでWhatです。"},{"id":"5-04-05","n":5,"kind":"cloze","q":"That bicycle belongs to Aya. It is ( hers / her / she ).","answer":"hers","accepted":["hers"],"why":"「彼女のもの」は所有代名詞hersです。"},{"id":"5-04-06","n":6,"kind":"cloze","q":"I ( am / is / are ) not afraid of dogs.","answer":"am","accepted":["am"],"why":"主語Iに対するbe動詞はamです。"},{"id":"5-04-07","n":7,"kind":"cloze","q":"You can ( use / uses / using ) my dictionary.","answer":"use","accepted":["use"],"why":"助動詞canの後には動詞の原形を置きます。"},{"id":"5-04-08","n":8,"kind":"cloze","q":"A: Is Tom studying? B: No, he is ( cook / cooks / cooking ).","answer":"cooking","accepted":["cooking"],"why":"isとing形で、今料理していることを表します。"},{"id":"5-04-09","n":9,"kind":"cloze","q":"We buy stamps at the ( post office / playground / bakery ).","answer":"post office","accepted":["post office"],"why":"切手を買う場所はpost officeです。"},{"id":"5-04-10","n":10,"kind":"cloze","q":"A: Do you play the piano? B: Yes, I ( do / am / can ).","answer":"do","accepted":["do"],"why":"Doで始まる質問にはdoで答えます。"},{"id":"5-04-11","n":11,"kind":"order","q":"私は毎晩、皿を洗います。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( the / every / I / wash / night / dishes )","answer":"I wash the dishes every night.","accepted":["I wash the dishes every night."],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-04-12","n":12,"kind":"order","q":"あなたのお姉さんは何歳ですか。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( How / sister / is / old / your )","answer":"How old is your sister?","accepted":["How old is your sister?"],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-04-13","n":13,"kind":"order","q":"テーブルの上にリンゴが三つあります。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( are / table / There / three / apples / on / the )","answer":"There are three apples on the table.","accepted":["There are three apples on the table."],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-04-14","n":14,"kind":"order","q":"その猫は椅子の下で寝ています。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( cat / under / The / is / chair / the / sleeping )","answer":"The cat is sleeping under the chair.","accepted":["The cat is sleeping under the chair."],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-04-15","n":15,"kind":"reading","q":"Samが好きな活動を英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"fishing","accepted":["fishing"],"why":"本文の根拠：My brother likes swimming, but I like fishing.","context":"Hi Jun, I live near the sea. My brother likes swimming, but I like fishing. We go to the beach on Saturdays. Our grandmother comes with us today. She has a big lunch box. We eat rice and chicken under a tree. From Sam.","title":"A letter from Sam","evidence":"My brother likes swimming, but I like fishing."},{"id":"5-04-16","n":16,"kind":"reading","q":"海辺に行く曜日を本文と同じ英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"Saturdays","accepted":["Saturdays"],"why":"本文の根拠：We go to the beach on Saturdays.","context":"Hi Jun, I live near the sea. My brother likes swimming, but I like fishing. We go to the beach on Saturdays. Our grandmother comes with us today. She has a big lunch box. We eat rice and chicken under a tree. From Sam.","title":"A letter from Sam","evidence":"We go to the beach on Saturdays."},{"id":"5-04-17","n":17,"kind":"reading","q":"今日一緒に来る家族を英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"grandmother","accepted":["grandmother"],"why":"本文の根拠：Our grandmother comes with us today.","context":"Hi Jun, I live near the sea. My brother likes swimming, but I like fishing. We go to the beach on Saturdays. Our grandmother comes with us today. She has a big lunch box. We eat rice and chicken under a tree. From Sam.","title":"A letter from Sam","evidence":"Our grandmother comes with us today."},{"id":"5-04-18","n":18,"kind":"reading","q":"なくしたスカーフの色を英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"green","accepted":["green"],"why":"本文の根拠：I cannot find my green scarf.","context":"I cannot find my green scarf. I had it on the school bus this morning. It has a picture of a star. Please tell Ms. Hill if you find it. She is in the music room after lunch. My name is Alice.","title":"A lost scarf","evidence":"I cannot find my green scarf."},{"id":"5-04-19","n":19,"kind":"reading","q":"スカーフの絵に描かれているものを英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"star","accepted":["star"],"why":"本文の根拠：It has a picture of a star.","context":"I cannot find my green scarf. I had it on the school bus this morning. It has a picture of a star. Please tell Ms. Hill if you find it. She is in the music room after lunch. My name is Alice.","title":"A lost scarf","evidence":"It has a picture of a star."},{"id":"5-04-20","n":20,"kind":"reading","q":"Ms. Hillが昼食後にいる教室の種類を英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"music","accepted":["music"],"why":"本文の根拠：She is in the music room after lunch.","context":"I cannot find my green scarf. I had it on the school bus this morning. It has a picture of a star. Please tell Ms. Hill if you find it. She is in the music room after lunch. My name is Alice.","title":"A lost scarf","evidence":"She is in the music room after lunch."}]},{"n":5,"questions":[{"id":"5-05-01","n":1,"kind":"cloze","q":"There ( is / are / am ) a clock above the door.","answer":"is","accepted":["is"],"why":"a clockは単数なのでThere isです。"},{"id":"5-05-02","n":2,"kind":"cloze","q":"My cousin usually ( studies / study / studying ) after dinner.","answer":"studies","accepted":["studies"],"why":"子音字とyで終わるstudyは、三人称単数でstudiesになります。"},{"id":"5-05-03","n":3,"kind":"cloze","q":"The ball is ( between / during / about ) the two chairs.","answer":"between","accepted":["between"],"why":"二つのものの間はbetweenです。"},{"id":"5-05-04","n":4,"kind":"cloze","q":"A: ( How / Which / What ) much is this notebook? B: Two dollars.","answer":"How","accepted":["How"],"why":"金額をたずねる定型表現はHow muchです。"},{"id":"5-05-05","n":5,"kind":"cloze","q":"We like this park because ( it / its / it's ) is quiet.","answer":"it","accepted":["it"],"why":"文の主語が必要なのでitです。it'sではisが重複します。"},{"id":"5-05-06","n":6,"kind":"cloze","q":"( Does / Do / Are ) your sister speak French?","answer":"Does","accepted":["Does"],"why":"主語your sisterは三人称単数なのでDoesです。"},{"id":"5-05-07","n":7,"kind":"cloze","q":"Don't ( touch / touches / touching ) the hot pan.","answer":"touch","accepted":["touch"],"why":"Don'tの後は動詞の原形です。"},{"id":"5-05-08","n":8,"kind":"cloze","q":"The players are ( run / running / runs ) around the field.","answer":"running","accepted":["running"],"why":"areとing形。runはnを重ねてrunningにします。"},{"id":"5-05-09","n":9,"kind":"cloze","q":"I use a ( ruler / pillow / fork ) to draw a straight line.","answer":"ruler","accepted":["ruler"],"why":"直線を引く道具はrulerです。"},{"id":"5-05-10","n":10,"kind":"cloze","q":"A: Are you ready? B: Yes, I ( am / do / are ).","answer":"am","accepted":["am"],"why":"Are youに対する答えでは主語がIになるのでamです。"},{"id":"5-05-11","n":11,"kind":"order","q":"私の父は朝、新聞を読みます。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( morning / newspaper / the / father / a / in / My / reads )","answer":"My father reads a newspaper in the morning.","accepted":["My father reads a newspaper in the morning."],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-05-12","n":12,"kind":"order","q":"あなたは何冊、本を持っていますか。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( books / you / have / How / many / do )","answer":"How many books do you have?","accepted":["How many books do you have?"],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-05-13","n":13,"kind":"order","q":"私たちは放課後にテニスをします。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( tennis / school / play / after / We )","answer":"We play tennis after school.","accepted":["We play tennis after school."],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-05-14","n":14,"kind":"order","q":"私は今、朝食を作っています。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( I / am / making / now / breakfast )","answer":"I am making breakfast now.","accepted":["I am making breakfast now."],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-05-15","n":15,"kind":"reading","q":"Ninaが学校用に必要としているものを英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"shoes","accepted":["shoes"],"why":"本文の根拠：Nina needs new shoes for school.","context":"Nina takes a train to town with her mother. They leave home at nine. Nina needs new shoes for school. Her mother needs a hat. They eat lunch at a cafe at twelve. Nina has tomato soup. They come home at two.","title":"A trip to town","evidence":"Nina needs new shoes for school."},{"id":"5-05-16","n":16,"kind":"reading","q":"昼食は何時ですか。数字で答えなさい。","answer":"12","accepted":["12"],"why":"本文の根拠：They eat lunch at a cafe at twelve.","context":"Nina takes a train to town with her mother. They leave home at nine. Nina needs new shoes for school. Her mother needs a hat. They eat lunch at a cafe at twelve. Nina has tomato soup. They come home at two.","title":"A trip to town","evidence":"They eat lunch at a cafe at twelve."},{"id":"5-05-17","n":17,"kind":"reading","q":"Ninaのスープに使われる野菜を英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"tomato","accepted":["tomato"],"why":"本文の根拠：Nina has tomato soup.","context":"Nina takes a train to town with her mother. They leave home at nine. Nina needs new shoes for school. Her mother needs a hat. They eat lunch at a cafe at twelve. Nina has tomato soup. They come home at two.","title":"A trip to town","evidence":"Nina has tomato soup."},{"id":"5-05-18","n":18,"kind":"reading","q":"料理の授業がある曜日を英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"Wednesday","accepted":["Wednesday"],"why":"本文の根拠：Our cooking lesson is on Wednesday.","context":"Our cooking lesson is on Wednesday. We make fruit salad this time. Bring an apple and a banana. We have oranges at school. Wash your hands before the lesson. You can take the salad home in your lunch box. The lesson ends at three.","title":"A cooking lesson","evidence":"Our cooking lesson is on Wednesday."},{"id":"5-05-19","n":19,"kind":"reading","q":"学校に用意してある果物を本文と同じ英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"oranges","accepted":["oranges"],"why":"本文の根拠：We have oranges at school.","context":"Our cooking lesson is on Wednesday. We make fruit salad this time. Bring an apple and a banana. We have oranges at school. Wash your hands before the lesson. You can take the salad home in your lunch box. The lesson ends at three.","title":"A cooking lesson","evidence":"We have oranges at school."},{"id":"5-05-20","n":20,"kind":"reading","q":"授業前に洗うものを本文と同じ英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"hands","accepted":["hands"],"why":"本文の根拠：Wash your hands before the lesson.","context":"Our cooking lesson is on Wednesday. We make fruit salad this time. Bring an apple and a banana. We have oranges at school. Wash your hands before the lesson. You can take the salad home in your lunch box. The lesson ends at three.","title":"A cooking lesson","evidence":"Wash your hands before the lesson."}]},{"n":6,"questions":[{"id":"5-06-01","n":1,"kind":"cloze","q":"There ( are / is / am ) five ducks on the pond.","answer":"are","accepted":["are"],"why":"five ducksは複数なのでThere areです。"},{"id":"5-06-02","n":2,"kind":"cloze","q":"Our teacher ( goes / go / going ) to school by train.","answer":"goes","accepted":["goes"],"why":"三人称単数の現在形でgoはgoesになります。"},{"id":"5-06-03","n":3,"kind":"cloze","q":"School ends at three. My music lesson starts at four, ( after / during / under ) school.","answer":"after","accepted":["after"],"why":"授業終了後の時間なのでafter school。duringは授業中で、時刻と合いません。"},{"id":"5-06-04","n":4,"kind":"cloze","q":"A: ( Where / When / Why ) are the towels? B: In the bathroom.","answer":"Where","accepted":["Where"],"why":"場所を尋ねているのでWhereです。"},{"id":"5-06-05","n":5,"kind":"cloze","q":"This is my father. Please help ( him / he / his ).","answer":"him","accepted":["him"],"why":"helpの目的語にはhimを使います。"},{"id":"5-06-06","n":6,"kind":"cloze","q":"A: Does Yui eat breakfast? B: Yes, she ( does / is / do ).","answer":"does","accepted":["does"],"why":"Doesで始まる質問の答えはdoesです。"},{"id":"5-06-07","n":7,"kind":"cloze","q":"Please ( close / closes / closing ) the window. It is cold.","answer":"close","accepted":["close"],"why":"命令文は動詞の原形で始めます。"},{"id":"5-06-08","n":8,"kind":"cloze","q":"My grandmother is ( makes / making / make ) a cake now.","answer":"making","accepted":["making"],"why":"be動詞とing形。makeのeを取ってmakingです。"},{"id":"5-06-09","n":9,"kind":"cloze","q":"My hands are dirty. I need ( soap / salt / sugar ) to wash them.","answer":"soap","accepted":["soap"],"why":"手を洗うための石けんはsoapです。"},{"id":"5-06-10","n":10,"kind":"cloze","q":"I don't have a red pen, ( but / or / because ) I have a blue one.","answer":"but","accepted":["but"],"why":"持っていないものと持っているものを対比するbutです。"},{"id":"5-06-11","n":11,"kind":"order","q":"私は週末には早く起きません。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( not / up / weekends / early / on / get / I / do )","answer":"I do not get up early on weekends.","accepted":["I do not get up early on weekends."],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-06-12","n":12,"kind":"order","q":"あなたの好きな教科は何ですか。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( your / What / subject / favorite / is )","answer":"What is your favorite subject?","accepted":["What is your favorite subject?"],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-06-13","n":13,"kind":"order","q":"駅の近くに図書館があります。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( There / the / is / a / station / near / library )","answer":"There is a library near the station.","accepted":["There is a library near the station."],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-06-14","n":14,"kind":"order","q":"その子供たちはプールで泳いでいます。（語句を並べ替えて英文にする）\n( in / children / pool / swimming / the / The / are )","answer":"The children are swimming in the pool.","accepted":["The children are swimming in the pool."],"why":"日本語の意味に合う主語と動詞を最初に確認し、動詞が求める目的語・補語を続けます。時や場所のまとまりを崩さず、すべての語句を一回ずつ使います。"},{"id":"5-06-15","n":15,"kind":"reading","q":"Danの年齢を数字で答えなさい。","answer":"12","accepted":["12"],"why":"本文の根拠：Their son, Dan, is twelve.","context":"A new family lives next to our house. Their son, Dan, is twelve. He has a dog named Coco. Dan likes baseball. I like baseball too. We play together in the park after school. His little sister watches us and takes pictures.","title":"My new neighbor","evidence":"Their son, Dan, is twelve."},{"id":"5-06-16","n":16,"kind":"reading","q":"Danの犬の名前を英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"Coco","accepted":["Coco"],"why":"本文の根拠：He has a dog named Coco.","context":"A new family lives next to our house. Their son, Dan, is twelve. He has a dog named Coco. Dan likes baseball. I like baseball too. We play together in the park after school. His little sister watches us and takes pictures.","title":"My new neighbor","evidence":"He has a dog named Coco."},{"id":"5-06-17","n":17,"kind":"reading","q":"二人がするスポーツを英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"baseball","accepted":["baseball"],"why":"本文の根拠：Dan likes baseball. I like baseball too.","context":"A new family lives next to our house. Their son, Dan, is twelve. He has a dog named Coco. Dan likes baseball. I like baseball too. We play together in the park after school. His little sister watches us and takes pictures.","title":"My new neighbor","evidence":"Dan likes baseball. I like baseball too."},{"id":"5-06-18","n":18,"kind":"reading","q":"窓を掃除する人の名前を英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"Ken","accepted":["Ken"],"why":"本文の根拠：Ken washes the windows.","context":"Today our class cleans the classroom. Ken washes the windows. Yuna cleans the desks. I put the books on the shelves. We find three pencils under a chair. They are Ken's pencils. After cleaning, our teacher gives us a drink.","title":"A clean classroom","evidence":"Ken washes the windows."},{"id":"5-06-19","n":19,"kind":"reading","q":"椅子の下で見つけた鉛筆の本数を数字で答えなさい。","answer":"3","accepted":["3"],"why":"本文の根拠：We find three pencils under a chair.","context":"Today our class cleans the classroom. Ken washes the windows. Yuna cleans the desks. I put the books on the shelves. We find three pencils under a chair. They are Ken's pencils. After cleaning, our teacher gives us a drink.","title":"A clean classroom","evidence":"We find three pencils under a chair."},{"id":"5-06-20","n":20,"kind":"reading","q":"見つけた鉛筆の持ち主を英語1語で答えなさい。","answer":"Ken","accepted":["Ken"],"why":"本文の根拠：They are Ken's pencils.","context":"Today our class cleans the classroom. Ken washes the windows. Yuna cleans the desks. I put the books on the shelves. We find three pencils under a chair. They are Ken's pencils. After cleaning, our teacher gives us a drink.","title":"A clean classroom","evidence":"They are Ken's pencils."}]},{"n":7,"questions":[{"id":"5-07-01","n":1,"kind":"cloze","q":"This room has two windows. ( Both / Every / Each ) are open.","answer":"Both","accepted":["Both"],"why":"二つともを表すBothは複数としてareを続けます。"},{"id":"5-07-02","n":2,"kind":"cloze","q":"My little brother ( watches / watch / watching ) cartoons on weekends.","answer":"watches","accepted":["watches"],"why":"watchは三人称単数でesを付けます。"},{"id":"5-07-03","n":3,"kind":"cloze","q":"We have lunch ( at / in / on ) noon.","answer":"at","accepted":["at"],"why":"正午はat noonと言います。"},{"id":"5-07-04","n":4,"kind":"cloze","q":"A: ( What / Who / Where ) time is it? B: It's four thirty.","answer":"What","accepted":["What"],"why":"時刻を尋ねる形はWhat timeです。"},{"id":"5-07-05","n":5,"kind":"cloze","q":"Those bags belong to us. They are ( ours / our / we ).","answer":"ours","acce